# Google Gemini API key. Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# If left unset, Misko still runs fully — the diagnosis/hint layer falls back to
# deterministic templates instead of Gemini (see src/lib/ai/fallback.ts).
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the Gemini model (default: gemini-flash-latest)
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-latest

# Optional: where the JSON-file datastore lives (default: your OS temp
# directory). The default means your data can be cleared on reboot; set this
# if you want it to persist somewhere stable across restarts. Must be OUTSIDE
# this project folder if you're using `next dev` — its file watcher scopes
# the whole project directory, and writing the store inside it triggers a
# write -> recompile -> write loop that makes the dev server unresponsive
# (see src/lib/store.ts). A path like ~/misko-data works; ./data does not.
# MISKO_DATA_DIR=/home/you/misko-data
